    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d623">

                <pb facs="0613" n="605" xml:id="pg605"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">367N.1115/218: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Consul at Jerusalem</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Steger</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1941-05-07T19:00:00-04:00">May 7, 1941—7 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your 63, 1st. It is anticipated that such vessels as may be sent to the Red Sea
                    will not be suitable or available for the transportation of passengers.</p>
                <p>Suggest you keep in touch with Legation Cairo concerning availability
                    transportation facilities for returning Americans.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
